      "created_at": "2014-12-29T19:23:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No glitch. With Sub-zero atmosphere, all end actions happen at start. Omni plays a card at the end, which is actually the start. Since it is still the start, EPE goes off immediately. Not always a good idea to play Sub-Zero against Omni.</p>",
